WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.930
All right! Here.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.440
Here you go. Careful!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.690
Hold on. All right!

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.150
Lord Hayate,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:18.610
thanks to you, Gon and his men will be taken
to the royal capital's prison camp,

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.550
and our transport team will
be able to set out safely.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.360
As someone who serves the kingdom,

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.020
I have only fulfilled my
duties as expected of me.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:34.650
I trust that sincere, earnest nature of yours,
and so I have a favor to ask of you.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.090
If it's something within my capabilities...

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.570
This letter is for your
esteemed father, Lord Gouki.

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.550
If you could pass it to him, for me...

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:43.930
To my father?

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.450
It is a very important letter.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.520
If you could give it to him personally,
I would greatly appreciate it.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:50.930
I understand.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.950
I must go to the next village
for their tax evaluation,

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:56.220
so I won't return to the royal
capital until after that,

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:57.690
but I will, without fail.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.530
Will that be acceptable?

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:01.030
You have my thanks.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.710
Stay safe!

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.630
And so, we all...

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.530
traveled together, and parted
with Lord Hayate along the way.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:23.630
We didn't reach the royal capital of the
Karasuki Kingdom until several days later.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.780
This is where we'll be staying.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.650
If you get lost, you won't
be able to make it back,

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.640
so when you leave the premises, make sure
to go with someone who knows the capital.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.820
I've got to go out, so I'll
leave the rest to you.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.550
Rio, Shin, will you come with me?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.670
Yes.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.960
Me, too?

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.340
Come on.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.320
That dirtbag.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.580
I was thinking of killing him.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.540
Not a very satisfying end, is it?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:49.500
Come on, now.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.570
Don't just sit there looking depressed.
Time for your emotions to change tacks.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.770
C-Cut that out, Huntmaster!
This guy's watching!

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.760
Three large servings of kamutan!
Thanks for waiting!

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.130
This is kamutan?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:07.280
Huh? Rio, you've never had kamutan before?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.990
N-No, I haven't.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.510
Once you have, you'll start craving it.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:14.670
The first time you ate it, it was an
emotional experience, right, Shin?

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.600
I suppose...

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:20.440
With kamutan, slurping it up dynamically
is the classy way to do it!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.220
Come on, Rio. If you don't
eat it, it'll get soggy.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.980
I will. Thank you for the meal.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.200
This is delicious!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.200
Right?

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.870
Yes!

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.840
Thank you!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.230
Hey!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.270
Thanks for what you did for Sayo.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.180
What?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:51.510
Oh, right.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:56.690
I need to make sure she gets to eat this,
or else we'll get into another fight.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:05.580
Is that everything we were needed to get?

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.570
Yes. Thank you so much, Sir Rio!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:12.200
But asking me, someone unused
to the town, to go shopping...

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.200
I can't imagine what everyone was thinking.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.990
If you'd like, shall we go
eat some kamutan after this?

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:18.650
What?

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:23.460
Master Shin asked me to take you
if we could manage it, Miss Sayo.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.130
My brother did that?

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.730
He said he'd asked you to make it for him,

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:31.010
but you got into a fight, saying you couldn't
make it since you'd never eaten it.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.080
He said he wanted to make sure
you couldn't say that next time.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.490
Honestly, he's such a glutton.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:40.270
But I think maybe he just wants to give
you the chance to eat some, Miss Sayo.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:41.590
What?

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:43.980
He's a nice older brother, isn't he?

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.320
Yes, he is.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.220
You there, young man!

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:51.990
How about a gift for that
cute girlfriend of yours?

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.700
I-I'm not his girlfriend or anything!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.440
Oh, my! You look so
good together, I just assumed.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.470
But how about just one souvenir of the capital?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.710
We have some very nice
wares here, wouldn't you agree?

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:06.440
That's true. Since we're
here and everything...

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:09.220
Miss Sayo, is there anything you want?

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.720
What? I-I'm fine!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:15.670
You've done so much for me,
Miss Sayo. Please, don't hesitate.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.050
Yes, yes.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:21.730
Miss, at times like these, quietly accepting
the gift shows a lady's courteousness.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.060
Really?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.830
Miss, you're very good
at business, aren't you?

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.990
Thanks!

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.930
My, miss, what a good eye you have!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.780
That's one of our finest items.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.870
Would you like to try it on?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:40.790
What?

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.260
What do you think, young man?

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.630
It really suits you.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.100
Doesn't it? It looks so lovely on you!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.470
But the price is just so high.
It's two lesser silver tablets.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.200
L-Lesser silver tablets?

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.790
All right.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.970
S-Sir Rio, it's all right!
I really don't need...

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.860
I might be able to give
just a little discount.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.860
I could never haggle over the
price of a gift for a lady.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.680
Very impressive!

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.620
In that case, I should have
set the price a little higher.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:18.740
Shall we go?

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.790
Th-Thank you so much!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.830
Young lady!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.990
Do your best to make him yours!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:28.120
It seems to me there'll be a lot of
competition for that young man.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.340
You ruffian! Unhand me!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.470
Someone, get him!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.600
Outta the way! Outta the way!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:41.900
What?

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.360
Miss Sayo! Are you all right?

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.190
Y-Yes, I'm fine.

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:53.200
Lady Komomo!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:59.080
She seems to be unconscious, but I don't
think there's any risk to her life.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:02.850
M-My apologies. This is all due
to my hopeless incompetence.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.660
If you're going to apologize,
apologize to her when she wakes.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.380
What happened?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.370
What's going on?

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:11.090
Clear a path!

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.420
Let's go, Miss Sayo.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:16.150
What? But... are you sure?

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.560
Yes. I want to avoid any kind of trouble.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.720
Please, wait!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:22.930
Are you all right?

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.190
You're not hurt?

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.420
Komomo was almost kidnapped?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.520
We're lucky that they were unsuccessful.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:36.160
The young man who saved Komomo
and apprehended the perpetrators

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.900
quickly departed the scene, they tell me.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.910
So, you said you wanted a private word?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.050
Yes.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:47.420
Lady Yuba entrusted me
with this for you, Father.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.420
She said that it was an important letter,
and I should give it to you in person.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.880
I see. From Lady Yuba.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.260
Hayate...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.080
Yes?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.800
Did you meet someone named Rio?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.060
We're back!

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.410
Hey, good work.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:19.660
Big Brother, the kamutan was delicious!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:20.640
Huh?

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:24.910
Then, when we get back to the village,
this time you'll make some for me, right?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.820
Yes. I'll do my best!

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.600
Sayo, where did you get that hairpin?

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.170
Huh?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.330
Oh, um, well...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.930
I'll go put these away.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.240
Lord Rio!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.920
Lord Hayate?

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:53.920
I am called Saga Gouki.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.650
I am Kayoko.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:02.070
We are husband and wife, and we
were both once attendants of your mother...

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:06.180
Lady Karasuki Ayame.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.540
Karasuki... Ayame?

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.790
Your surprise is understandable.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:21.050
Lord Rio, your mother was of the royal
family of the Kingdom of Karasuki.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.890
My mother... was royalty?

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:34.610
First, shall I tell you about my
connection to your father Zen, Lord Rio?

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:36.190
Yes.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.550
It happened over twenty years ago.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:45.200
At the time, the Karasuki Kingdom was at
war with our neighboring kingdom, Rokuren.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:48.190
Zen volunteered to be a soldier.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:53.000
Zen had a natural gift for both
the spirit arts and martial arts.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:57.640
His Majesty the King soon bestowed
upon him the rank of warrior-noble.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.310
At that time, he had a bout with me.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.730
His skills were the real thing.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.740
Because of that,

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:13.140
I strongly recommended that he should
guard members of the royal family.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.200
I am sure you can already guess that the
member of the royal family he guarded...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.450
...was Lady Ayame.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:30.330
Lady Ayame took a liking to Zen.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:40.320
And it was at that time that a truce was
negotiated with the Kingdom of Rokuren.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.290
At the ceremony celebrating the truce,

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.450
the prince who had come as ambassador
took a liking to Lady Ayame,

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.800
and tried to have his attendants abduct her.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.820
Zen kept them from completing their plan,

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.690
but the prince resented the fact that
his attendant had been killed.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:01.110
If the truce were to be finalized,
the prince demanded Zen's execution,

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:05.100
and a political marriage to Lady Ayame.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:10.190
Even now, the thought of
it makes my blood seethe.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:14.460
And that's why my mother and
father ran away together?

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:16.460
Yes.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.290
His Majesty the King
arranged for it in secret,

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.450
and the two of them left our country.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:26.000
And so time flowed on, with no
news or contact with them.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.300
But today, I received
correspondence from Lady Yuba.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:33.730
And having looked upon your honored
countenance, Lord Rio, I am certain.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.480
There can be no doubt that you are their son.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.730
Yes.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:44.320
Lord Rio, tomorrow, will you
come to the castle?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.280
What?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.710
His Majesty the King and
Her Highness the Queen...

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:51.950
It is my dearest wish that you
and they might meet, Lord Rio.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.300
The two of them... and me?

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:57.710
Please. Please, I beg of you.

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.040
All right, I will.

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.310
So you are Rio?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:15.880
I am honored to meet you, Your Majesties.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.560
King Homura, Queen Shizuku, my name is Rio.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.840
This is a meeting with
our darling grandchild.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:25.700
Would it be possible for you
to be less formal with us?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.320
Yes, please.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:32.180
If you permit it, then... I will do my best.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.060
First, will you take a seat?

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.460
Yes. Thank you.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.640
Rio, you really do look exactly like Ayame.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:47.680
I feel that it's you, Queen Shizuku,
who looks just like my mother.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.100
My, do you think so?

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.990
Rio, will you tell us?

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.890
Tell us about Ayame and Zen.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:57.730
Yes.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:04.480
To cut straight to the conclusion,
both of them have already died.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:10.000
It is how they died and how they lived
that we would like to hear.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:16.000
My father died when I was
too young to know him.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:20.460
My mother was a kind person
who never stopped smiling.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:26.080
She never showed me her
grief at my father's death.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:30.970
We were by no means affluent,
but every day was a happy one.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.890
But when I was five, my mother passed away.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.100
When you were five?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.620
How did Ayame die?

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:45.780
If I tell you the truth, it will
be incredibly painful to hear.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.780
Even so, we want to know.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:50.810
My mother...

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.340
was killed...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.750
right in front of me.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:15:00.610
The person who killed her
is a man named Lucius.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.180
Apparently he had worked with
my father as an adventurer.

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:07.050
After my father's death,
he'd helped us in many ways.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.280
But that day...

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:14.430
I'll be back soon. If anyone you
don't know comes, you stay inside.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.160
I will!

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.980
Rio, it's me. It's Lucius.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.310
Will you open the door?

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:39.390
In this world, there are demons
who masquerade in human skins.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.460
You're one fact smarter now.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.710
What are you doing, Master Lucius?!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:47.640
Rio!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:52.550
What have you done to him?
Let go! Let go right now!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.550
Rio...

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.520
Mother...

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.030
That is my last memory of my mother.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.320
How could this be...

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:18.330
And how have you lived since then?

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:25.450
When I woke up, I'd been left in the slums.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.620
I stayed there and lived as an orphan.

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.720
Though that was only until I was seven.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.220
What happened then?

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.270
There was... an incident where
I happened to rescue someone

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:39.830
of importance to the kingdom.

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:45.600
I was allowed to attend an educational
institution run by the kingdom.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.880
In our kingdom,

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:50.170
we have a school for the court nobles
and some of the warrior-nobles, but...

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.570
Everyone around me was of similar rank.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.670
That must have been difficult for you.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:56.880
I was treated a little harshly,

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.270
but there were people who treated me well, too.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:04.220
Thanks to them, I can hold my head high
and say my days there were enjoyable.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.330
I attended that school until I was twelve,

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.680
then I set out for this land that my
mother had promised to show me one day.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.690
Ayame made such a promise?

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:22.060
Both you and Ayame must
harbor a deep hatred for us.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.730
I think my mother was grateful to you...

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.280
for being able to marry my father.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:33.280
It would make no sense for me to
hate you in the face of that, would it?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.630
I see.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.720
But Rio...

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.280
The man who killed Ayame...

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.330
I don't think I can forgive him.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.660
That man is the one person
I will never forgive.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:48.290
Then, do you hope for revenge?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.120
Once, that was all
I thought about. It kept me alive.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.980
But revenge doesn't create anything.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:56.480
And my mother wouldn't want it, either.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.910
I've thought those things, too.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:03.390
Even so, if I ever met that man...

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.810
With these hands, I would...

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.260
I see.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.650
But you know, Rio...

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:14.020
If you travel the path of revenge,
what you will find is hell.

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:14.710
I know.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.900
You can still turn back.
Will you proceed, even so?

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.060
I am determined to proceed, even so.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.410
If it's necessary, I would not
hesitate to dirty my own hands.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.520
Then, I won't stop you.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.360
But before that, I would
like you to spar with Gouki.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.920
With Lord Gouki?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:37.740
There is no match for Gouki in
any of the surrounding kingdoms.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:40.360
He is the Karasuki Kingdom's
strongest warrior.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:43.830
This man named Lucius must be very skilled.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:48.250
Considering his hideous nature,
he may even have killed Zen.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.130
Don't you think so, Gouki?

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:56.800
I don't want to admit it,
but it is definitely possible.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:19:01.450
If you are to one day face Lucius, then you
will require strength, will you not?

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.900
I understand.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.450
If he is willing to teach me
the basics, then, yes, please.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:13.010
Father! Mother! Welcome home!

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:14.260
You're...

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.490
Aoi, what is it?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:21.790
Th-The person you're with is the
one who saved Lady Komomo!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.680
What's this? Is that right?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.310
Oh, I just...

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:30.310
Then we will proceed with combat forms.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.840
Both parties, at the ready.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.110
Begin!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:52.180
Your potential is frightening.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:54.950
And to think that in terms of both
physicality and experience,

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.550
you haven't yet reached your prime...

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.200
Training is the one thing
I've always kept up.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.560
You've done well!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:08.220
He combines sword work
with weaponless styles.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.560
Impressive!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:10.500
What?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.480
It can't be... Father is at a disadvantage?

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.860
This is thrilling!

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:26.870
Magical energy is gathering around his sword?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.870
F-Father! You can't be thinking of using...

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.230
Hidden Skill, First Blade...

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.320
Air Slash!

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:43.510
End of match!

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:47.010
The bout goes to Lord Rio!

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.520
I've lost this one.

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:55.990
Thank you very much.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:59.150
I can't believe Father has...

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.320
He's incredible.

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:02.840
Impressive.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:07.260
I had thought to have you train under Gouki,
but I see my solicitude was unnecessary.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:08.530
Yes.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:13.820
Not at all. Having this experience before
heading to Beltrum was invaluable.

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:15.990
Thank you for your concern.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:21.500
We don't have much time left,
but is there anything you wish to ask?

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:26.550
I have a cousin who lives in the
village where I've been staying.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:30.010
I would like to tell her
about my lineage, but...

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:34.020
Yes. We will trust your judgment in this.

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:36.480
Thank you.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.280
Welcome back!

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:45.620
Huh? Where's Rio?

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:48.610
Miss Ruri, Sir Rio is...

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:56.690
Father, Mother... I can't run anymore.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.100
In order to live, in order
to protect what's precious,

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:03.610
I will accept the ugliness
within me and move forward.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.170
"Each of Their Decisions."
